{
  "changelog": "Initial release of agent-transcript, a skill for redacting and safely inserting GitHub agent session transcripts.\n\n- Provides local-only tools to find, sanitize, preview, and insert agent session transcripts into PR/issue bodies.\n- Enforces strict redaction: removes secrets, private data, unrelated session turns, and raw logs.\n- Never uploads raw logs or uses network; operates entirely on local data.\n- Always asks the user before insertion and offers local HTML preview.\n- Automates transcript section trimming to ensure only relevant context is included.\n- Integrates cleanly into GitHub PR and issue workflows without requiring transcript if none is suitable.",
